"test":"R18: instanceAiCredential reads INSTANCE_AI_TOKEN; missing or empty is {token: null, reason: INSTANCE_AI_UNSET}"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R19: instanceAiCredential on a published value is {token: null, reason: INSTANCE_AI_PUBLISHED}"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R2: sync and cpuAwait count one call per use under the label, add finite bytes only, count before fn runs, return fn's result"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R20: instanceAiCredential on any other non-empty string returns it with reason null"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R21: the four reason constants have their stated values and are the only non-null reasons any service gives"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R22: pure — no clock outside cpuProbe's now: the same answer for the same inputs, whatever the clock shows"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R23: nothing exported accepts or sets a credential; the env passed in is only read"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R24: report never states a duration for synchronous work: measured_ms is null and the note says why"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R25: no place is named in anything the module says, and no behaviour depends on one"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R26: unattendedCredential: bound is synchronous presence of DAEMON_TOKEN or ADMIN_TOKEN; token() is the first live of the two, else null; no value on the object; never throws or rejects"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R3: report returns the sums over every label, a copy of the segments, measured_ms null and a note that these are counts"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R4: burn runs the same fixed arithmetic every time and never throws"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R5: cpuProbe's defaults are startStep 0, maxStep 40, budgetMs 20,000, now Date.now, iterationsPerStep 2,000,000; checkpoint has none"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R6: cpuProbe reads now once as t0, then per step burns, measures and awaits checkpoint(step + 1, elapsed) before the next step"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R7: after the first checkpointed step whose elapsed reaches budgetMs, cpuProbe returns BUDGET_REACHED and starts no other step"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R8: reaching maxStep under budget returns MAX_STEP_REACHED with maxStep and the last completed step's elapsed"},{"file":"bio-plane/test/m/runtime-limits/runtime-limits.test.mjs","side":"test","line":10,"test":"R9: sha256hex is the SHA-256 of the UTF-8 encoding, 64 lowercase hex characters, for any string"}]}
